sequenceDiagram
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant LC as LeadController
    participant LS as LeadService
    participant LEP as LeadEventPublisher
    participant RMQ as RabbitMQ
    participant LNL as LeadNotificationListener

    Note over FE,LNL: Fluxo 1: Mudança de status via histórico

    FE->>LC: POST /api/leads/{id}/history (status, note)
    LC->>LS: addHistory(id, request)
    LS->>LS: lead.addHistoryEntry(status, note)
    LS->>LS: lead.setStatus(mapStatus(status))
    LS->>LS: leadRepository.save(lead)
    LS->>LEP: publishStatusChanged(leadId, prefix, NOVO, FECHADO, timestamp)
    LEP->>RMQ: convertAndSend("lead.events", "lead.status-changed", event)
    LS-->>LC: LeadResponse
    LC-->>FE: 200 OK

    RMQ->>LNL: Deliver LeadStatusChangedEvent
    LNL->>LNL: Log "[NOTIFICAÇÃO] Lead mudou de status"

    Note over FE,LNL: Fluxo 2: Atribuição de lead

    FE->>LC: POST /api/leads/{id}/assignment (assignedTo, assignedBy)
    LC->>LS: assignLead(id, request)
    LS->>LS: lead.setAssignedTo(assignedTo)
    LS->>LS: leadRepository.save(lead)
    LS->>LEP: publishLeadAssigned(leadId, prefix, assignedTo, assignedBy, timestamp)
    LEP->>RMQ: convertAndSend("lead.events", "lead.assigned", event)
    LS-->>LC: LeadResponse
    LC-->>FE: 200 OK

    RMQ->>LNL: Deliver LeadAssignedEvent
    LNL->>LNL: Log "[NOTIFICAÇÃO] Lead atribuído a vendedor"
